@CleanArchitectureApi = http://localhost:5115

### List banks (page 1, 20 items by default)
GET {{CleanArchitectureApi}}/api/banks
Accept: application/json

### Create a bank
POST {{CleanArchitectureApi}}/api/banks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "BANK01",
  "name": "Example Bank"
}

### List transactions
GET {{CleanArchitectureApi}}/api/transactions?page=1&take=20
Accept: application/json
